{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# SU(3) chain [1,0,0] ⊗ [1,0,0], L = 2 — does the zero-twist norm formula hold for the fundamental?\n\nBoth sites in the **3 = [1,0,0]** (9 states, $3\\otimes3=6\\oplus\\bar3$). Same test as `SU3_310x210_L2_ZeroTwist.wb`, cells copied with suffix `Y` and only the representation data changed. Formula under test (`SU3_ZeroTwist_Formula.tex`):\n$$\n\\lim_{\\varepsilon\\to0}\\frac{V_{\\lambda_{\\rm vac}}(z)}{V_{\\lambda_A}(z)}\\,\\frac{\\langle L_A|R_A\\rangle}{\\langle L_A|0\\rangle\\langle0|R_A\\rangle}=\\frac{\\mathcal B_A}{\\mathcal B_{\\rm vac}},\\qquad \\mathcal B_A=E_{\\lambda_A}\\frac{\\det\\mathcal N^A}{c^{\\rm ref}_A\\Psi^{\\rm ref}_A}.\n$$\n\n**Predictions from the general rules:**\n- Measure $M=\\Gamma_h[\\nu_1]/\\Gamma_h[\\nu_3^{[2]}]$: poles $\\theta_s+\\{0,1\\}$ (4 poles). Here this coincides with $1/(\\nu_1\\nu_2\\nu_3)$.\n- $c=(\\lambda^{(1)}_1-\\lambda^{(1)}_3)+(\\lambda^{(2)}_1-\\lambda^{(2)}_3)+1=3$ (derived again in section 5, not assumed).\n- Twisted degrees $\\deg q_i=2-\\mu_i$, $\\deg q^j=\\mu_j$; vacuum $(2,0,0)$, other hw state $(1,1,0)$.\n- $E_{(2,0,0)}=-1/4$ and $E_{(1,1,0)}=-1$, so $E_A/E_{\\rm vac}=4$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. gl(3) L=2 chain, both sites in the fundamental [1,0,0]; twist enters only through TcoY. ---- *)\nClearAll[rep1Y, rep2Y, ds1Y, ds2Y, dcY, EE1Y, EE2Y, E1Y, E2Y, EtotY, thetaY, TmonY, qminorAtY, qcoY, buildChainY, TcoY, nuY, qdetY, u];\n\n(* GT machinery: identical to the equal-site notebooks (memoized per rep). *)\nps[rr_] := ps[rr] = Block[{res = Prepend[rr, #] & /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rr[[1, i + 1]], rr[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rr[[1]]] - 1}]]},\n    If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse@Sort@res, Reverse@Sort@Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]];\ndim[rr_] := dim[rr] = Length[ps[{rr}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/\n       Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/\n       Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rr_] := JJ[k, l, rr] = Which[\n    k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rr}]],\n    l == k + 1, Transpose@Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rr}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ ps[{rr}], {i, Length[ps[{rr}]]}],\n    l == k - 1, Transpose@Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rr}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ ps[{rr}], {i, Length[ps[{rr}]]}],\n    l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rr].JJ[k + 1, l, rr] - JJ[k + 1, l, rr].JJ[k, k + 1, rr],\n    l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rr].JJ[k - 1, l, rr] - JJ[k - 1, l, rr].JJ[k, k - 1, rr]];\n\nrep1Y = {1, 0, 0};\nrep2Y = {1, 0, 0};\nds1Y = dim[rep1Y];\nds2Y = dim[rep2Y];\ndcY = ds1Y ds2Y;\nEE1Y[i_, j_] := EE1Y[i, j] = SparseArray[JJ[i, j, rep1Y]];\nEE2Y[i_, j_] := EE2Y[i, j] = SparseArray[JJ[i, j, rep2Y]];\nE1Y[i_, j_] := E1Y[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[EE1Y[i, j], IdentityMatrix[ds2Y, SparseArray]];\nE2Y[i_, j_] := E2Y[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[ds1Y, SparseArray], EE2Y[i, j]];\nEtotY[i_, j_] := E1Y[i, j] + E2Y[i, j];\n\nTmonY[i_, j_][x_] := Sum[\n   ((x - thetaY[[1]]) KroneckerDelta[i, k] IdentityMatrix[dcY, SparseArray] - E1Y[k, i]).\n    ((x - thetaY[[2]]) KroneckerDelta[k, j] IdentityMatrix[dcY, SparseArray] - E2Y[j, k]), {k, 3}];\n(* Principal quantum minors at exact points; u-coefficients by exact interpolation on nodes 1..2|I|+1. *)\nqminorAtY[II_, x_] := Sum[Signature[s] Dot @@ Table[TmonY[II[[s[[k]]]], II[[k]]][x - (k - 1)], {k, Length[II]}],\n   {s, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\nbuildChainY[th_] := (thetaY = th;\n   Do[With[{d = 2 Length[II]},\n     With[{vals = Table[qminorAtY[II, n], {n, 1, d + 1}], vinv = Inverse[Table[n^k, {n, 1, d + 1}, {k, 0, d}]]},\n      Do[qcoY[II, k] = SparseArray[Sum[vinv[[k + 1, n]] vals[[n]], {n, 1, d + 1}]], {k, 0, d}]]],\n    {II, Join @@ (Subsets[Range[3], {#}] & /@ Range[3])}]);\nTcoY[a_, k_, z_List] := Sum[(Times @@ z[[II]]) qcoY[II, k], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\n\n(* nu_i carries the weight of each site separately. *)\nnuY[i_][x_] := (x - thetaY[[1]] - rep1Y[[i]]) (x - thetaY[[2]] - rep2Y[[i]]);\nqdetY[x_] := nuY[1][x - 2] nuY[2][x - 1] nuY[3][x];\n\nbuildChainY[{1/3, -8/57}];\n\nWith[{zt = {5/2, 7/3, 6/35}, zero = ConstantArray[0, {dcY, dcY}], uu = 13/7},\n Grid[{\n   {\"dims (site 1, site 2, chain)\", Row[{ds1Y, \", \", ds2Y, \", \", dcY}]},\n   {\"minor interpolation check at u = 13/7\",\n    And @@ Table[Normal[Sum[qcoY[II, k] uu^k, {k, 0, 2 Length[II]}] - qminorAtY[II, uu]] === zero,\n      {II, Join @@ (Subsets[Range[3], {#}] & /@ Range[3])}]},\n   {\"T1, T2 coefficients commute (z = {5/2,7/3,6/35})\",\n    And @@ Flatten@Table[Normal[TcoY[a, k, zt].TcoY[b, l, zt] - TcoY[b, l, zt].TcoY[a, k, zt]] === zero,\n       {a, 2}, {b, 2}, {k, 0, 2 a}, {l, 0, 2 b}]},\n   {\"T3 = nu1(u-2) nu2(u-1) nu3(u), per-site weights, unimodular twist\",\n    And @@ Table[Normal[TcoY[3, k, zt]] === Coefficient[Expand[qdetY[u]], u, k] IdentityMatrix[dcY], {k, 0, 6}]},\n   {\"zero twist: T_a commute with total gl(3)\",\n    And @@ Flatten@Table[Normal[TcoY[a, k, {1, 1, 1}].EtotY[i, j] - EtotY[i, j].TcoY[a, k, {1, 1, 1}]] === zero,\n       {a, 2}, {k, 0, 2 a}, {i, 3}, {j, 3}]}\n   }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"752601\" data-output-id=\"57\" data-out-n=\"602\" data-sub-idx=\"28\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"49\" data-sub-end=\"63\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[602]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"36\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dims (site 1, site 2, chain)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">minor interpolation check at u = 13/7</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T1, T2 coefficients commute (z = {5/2,7/3,6/35})</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T3 = nu1(u-2) nu2(u-1) nu3(u), per-site weights, unimodular twist</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">zero twist: T_a commute with total gl(3)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">, </span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">, </span></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[602]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{dims (site 1, site 2, chain)} & 3\\text{, }3\\text{, }9\\\\\\hline\\text{minor interpolation check at u = 13/7} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{T1, T2 coefficients commute (z = \\{5/2,7/3,6/35\\})} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{T3 = nu1(u-2) nu2(u-1) nu3(u), per-site weights, unimodular twist} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{zero twist: T\\_a commute with total gl(3)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
